{"asset_key":"ep1/quest_story_11115220","episode":"ep1","category":"quest_story","story_id":"11115220","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:1:1111522001:0":{"text":"終わったの……？","source_cn":"结束了……？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3E6F795EB2F850AE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1111522002:0":{"text":"信じられない……あたし、生きてる。","source_cn":"我还活着……真不敢相信。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1467C1643563BEF5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1111522003:0":{"text":"どう？アンダンドラ、君がいない間に、あたしだって頑張って戦えるようになったんだから！","source_cn":"安丹，看到了吗？你不在的这段时间，我也成长为可靠的战斗...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5698976C81CFC6DA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1111522004:0":{"text":"サテラお姉ちゃん！うわああんっ……サテラお姉ちゃんっ！","source_cn":"萨忒娜姐姐！呜呜呜……萨忒娜姐姐！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8BE4870CDBD7255E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1111522005:0":{"text":"わっ！ちょっ！？き、急に飛びついてこないでよ！","source_cn":"哎哎哎？你这小孩，不要突然扑过来啊！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x99A805E134F843FC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1111522006:0":{"text":"お姉ちゃんが敵の邪魔をしてくれなかったら、ココ、今頃死んじゃってたよ……！","source_cn":"要不是你在战斗中干扰敌人！我肯定再也见不到安丹姐姐了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x36513226450EE65F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1111522007:0":{"text":"アンお姉ちゃんを奪うなんて酷いこと言ったのに、それでもココを助けてくれてありがとうっ……！","source_cn":"我以为你会抢走安丹姐，所以一直对你很凶，你却依然愿意救...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB82DCA2F6290F929","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1111522008:0":{"text":"今日からサテラお姉ちゃんもアンお姉ちゃんと同じ、ココの一番好きな人だよっ！","source_cn":"从现在起，你和安丹姐姐都是我最喜欢的人了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6425C06F794E6B0F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1111522009:0":{"text":"はいはい、気持ちだけ受け取っておくわ。一番好きな人は一人だけよ、欲張っちゃだめ。","source_cn":"哼，留着你的好意吧， 最喜欢的人只能有一个，你可不要太贪心。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC2712D801225B47C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1111522010:0":{"text":"なら、サテラの一番好きな人は誰なんだ？","source_cn":"谁又是萨忒娜心中最喜欢的人呢？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1EB0FD09535FD0D0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1111522011:0":{"text":"自分で考えたら？アンの石頭じゃ、当分思いつかないでしょうけど！","source_cn":"你慢慢想吧，以你的死脑筋，我看你多久才能想出来！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7E7DF5F6D77094B4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1111522012:0":{"text":"やっと終わったな……","source_cn":"总算结束了……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x660252414BF40547","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1111522013:0":{"text":"あいつを封印すれば、クリムゾン高原は元に戻るのか？","source_cn":"将他封印后，深红高原就会恢复正常吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x95091FF6A8A33BF3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1111522014:0":{"text":"経験上、元通りになるには時間が必要です。","source_cn":"以我们之前的经验，恢复需要时间。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x665E64F504B2D588","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1111522015:0":{"text":"ですが、少なくともこれ以上悪化することはありません。少しずつ良くなりますよ。","source_cn":"起码，事态不会进一步恶化了，只会渐渐好转。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0B6626C7F008234C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:23:1111522016:0":{"text":"マスター、またもやカタストロフの危機を解決しましたね！鹹水町に戻ってお祝いしましょう！","source_cn":"主人，我们又一次解决了恶魔引发的危机，应该回咸水镇好好...","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xC8877724BC239EBF","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"マスター、またもやカタストロフの危機を解決しましたね！鹹水町に戻ってお祝いしましょう！","female":"マスター、またもやカタストロフの危機を解決しましたね！鹹水町に戻ってお祝いしましょう！","variant_male_record_index":"123410","variant_female_record_index":"123411","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:24:1111522017:0":{"text":"何がお祝いよ、あなたが美味しいものを食べたいだけでしょ？","source_cn":"说什么想庆祝，其实你是嘴馋了，想吃点好的吧？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5BC42A29AE01C151","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:25:1111522018:0":{"text":"私たち使い魔は魔力の補給で生きていけるのに、どうしてあなたはそんなに食いしん坊なの、ロンロン？","source_cn":"满满，你明明是一只只需要补给魔力就能生存的使魔，却那么贪吃。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7C6BE2B874E56191","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:26:1111522019:0":{"text":"マスター……メイメイがいじめるぅっ！","source_cn":"主人……漫漫欺负我！","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x6AD61F2AA51F6095","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"マスター……メイメイがいじめるぅっ！","female":"マスター……メイメイがいじめるぅっ！","variant_male_record_index":"123414","variant_female_record_index":"123415","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:27:1111522020:0":{"text":"まっ！今度は告げ口！？","source_cn":"满满！你还学会告状了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x03E9C66179CD18E7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:28:1111522021:0":{"text":"助けてマスター！メイメイをなんとかしてくださいいっ！","source_cn":"救命啊主人！您快管管漫漫啊！","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xDB027DCAA92A4D5A","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"助けてマスター！メイメイをなんとかしてくださいいっ！","female":"助けてマスター！メイメイをなんとかしてくださいいっ！","variant_male_record_index":"123417","variant_female_record_index":"123418","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:29:1111522022:0":{"text":"こんな騒がしいのも久しぶりだな。","source_cn":"久违了，这种吵吵闹闹的感觉。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x52577C7E7391A39E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:30:1111522023:0":{"text":"アルサがいると、いつもこんな感じだ。","source_cn":"在阿尔萨边上，耳旁总是这种声音。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5446581517FD4C0E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:31:1111522023":{"text":"アルサがいると、いつもこんな感じだ。","source_cn":"在阿尔萨边上，耳旁总是这种声音。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5446581517FD4C0E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:32:1111522024:0":{"text":"別に、そうは言ってない。","source_cn":"我可没说。","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x38FA7FE44BCEF60E","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"別に、そうは言ってない。","female":"別に、そうは言ってない。","variant_male_record_index":"123421","variant_female_record_index":"123422","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:33:1111522025:0":{"text":"まあ、これ以上ここにいたくないのは確かだな。","sourc